{
  "name": "RE Transaction Orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Transaction Orchestrator\n\n**TENEX Equivalent:** Project Manager (PM) coordinating workflow and delegating to specialists\n\n**Core Function:** Central hub monitoring all pipelines. Provides unified visibility across all four agents while they operate independently. Handles cross-agent triggers and exception escalation.\n\n## Orchestrator Functions\n- Unified Dashboard\n- Cross-Agent Triggers\n- Exception Handling\n- Performance Aggregation\n\n## Cross-Agent Events\n- Lead → Transaction handoff\n- Transaction → Client Success handoff\n- Listing → Marketing triggers",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -200],
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Orchestrator Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent Webhook Endpoints\n\n**Lead Nurturing Agent**\n- POST /webhook/new-lead\n\n**Transaction Coordinator Agent**\n- POST /webhook/new-transaction\n- POST /webhook/update-task\n\n**Marketing Automation Agent**\n- POST /webhook/new-listing\n- POST /webhook/listing-update\n- POST /webhook/just-sold\n\n**Client Success Agent**\n- POST /webhook/new-client",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, 220],
      "id": "sticky-endpoints",
      "name": "Agent Endpoints"
    },
